    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Weirdboy",
    "summary": "In the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), this unit can roll 1 D6 as a [psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities) when it is **selected to fight**, as long as it is not **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**. If it does:\n\n- a 1 makes this unit battle-shocked\n- for the rest of that phase, **Wound rolls** of 1 for its melee attacks may be re-rolled\n- for the rest of that phase, its melee attacks have **[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)**",
